  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "LadderLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXAMPLE / LEARNING DESIGN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Message ladder workbook"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderIntro",
      "text": "Prepare three introductions for the same listener. Keep your role, offer and next step consistent, then…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Define one message"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Speaker"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Mara Vale, independent learning designer"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Listener"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Public library programme leads planning a practical adult workshop"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Their practical need"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A useful session that staff can deliver again without rebuilding the materials"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Bounded offer"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "One workshop kit with an activity, participant materials and facilitator notes"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Shared next step"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Review one work sample together"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Evidence register"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "E01: fictional repair-workshop kit, version 1.0. The example comprises a lesson map, workbook and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Claim limits"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Do not promise learning gains, a delivery date or a fee before agreeing scope and evaluation."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Write the shortest version first. Add context at 30 seconds and one bounded example at 60 seconds. Read…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "The labels are targets. Word counts and ranges use a planning assumption of 120 to 150 words per…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "A longer version may add detail. It must not introduce a different promise, a stronger result or a new…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXAMPLE / LEARNING DESIGN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "15 seconds"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderCue",
      "text": "The useful core"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderScript15",
      "text": "I'm Mara, a learning designer. I help public library teams turn practical topics into workshop kits…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "27 words / Planning range 10.8 to 13.5 seconds at 120-150 words per minute, before pauses."
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderCue",
      "text": "Pause after your role. Let the listener hear the offer before the question."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Rewrite in your own voice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Keep the role, audience, offer and question. Write a version you would actually say."
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "Actual duration __________ seconds Date __________"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXAMPLE / LEARNING DESIGN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "30 seconds"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderCue",
      "text": "Add one explanation"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderScript30",
      "text": "I'm Mara, a learning designer. I help public library teams turn practical topics into workshop kits…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "52 words / Planning range 20.8 to 26 seconds at 120-150 words per minute, before pauses."
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderCue",
      "text": "Keep the useful skill concrete. Let the question invite an answer."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Rewrite in your own voice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Add only the context that helps this listener understand your work."
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "Actual duration __________ seconds Date __________"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXAMPLE / LEARNING DESIGN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "60 seconds"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderCue",
      "text": "Add one work example"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderScript60",
      "text": "I'm Mara, a learning designer. I help public library teams turn practical topics into workshop kits…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "107 words / Planning range 42.8 to 53.5 seconds at 120-150 words per minute, before pauses."
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderCue",
      "text": "Slow down around the evidence limit. Give the final question room."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Rewrite in your own voice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Retain the evidence limit. Remove detail that the listener does not need yet."
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "Actual duration __________ seconds Date __________"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXAMPLE / LEARNING DESIGN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Rehearse and revise"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderIntro",
      "text": "Read each version aloud at a comfortable pace. Record the actual duration. If a willing listener is…"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "No rehearsal has been performed for these examples. Leave actual duration and listener feedback empty…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What stayed consistent"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Compare the role, audience, offer, evidence status and next step across all three versions. Record any…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Ready to use"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Before sharing, check every factual claim, name your own contribution, confirm permission to disclose…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Method sources"
    },
    {
      "style": "LadderMeta",
      "text": "Toastmasters International: Preparing a Speech; Keep Your Speech Within Time Limits. Source links and…"
    }
